# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# SmartSchemes Frontend — Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# All frontend env vars must be prefixed with VITE_.

# ── Backend API URL ──────────────────────────────
# Leave empty for local dev (Vite proxy handles /api → localhost:5000).
# Set to your deployed backend URL for production builds.
VITE_API_URL=

# ── Supabase (required for auth) ─────────────────
# Use the ANON (public) key here — NOT the service role key.
# Get from: https://supabase.com/dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key
